9-4f20-90a2-891f38eaace8\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Sarah Johnson<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; color: #65768D;\">VP Marketing<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; flex: none;\">Delivered<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n                <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 7px; padding: 8px 10px; animation: deliverIn 7s ease-in-out .6s infinite;\"><img src=\"00b87709-f1bb-448b-8bc5-0326a42411ec\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Michael Anderson<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; color: #65768D;\">Head of Sales<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; flex: none;\">Delivered<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n                <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 7px; padding: 8px 10px; animation: deliverIn 7s ease-in-out 1s infinite;\"><img src=\"81580bce-50d6-4077-93ff-73183df645b1\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Jessica Brown<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; color: #65768D;\">RevOps Manager<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; flex: none;\">Delivered<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n              <\u002Fdiv>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n            <div style=\"margin-top: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #F7F5FE; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 14px; flex: none;\">\n              <span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #45556C; min-width: 0;\">Senders rotated automatically<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063;\">99.2% delivered<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"flow\" style=\"padding: 0 0 96px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n      <span style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">How it works<\u002Fspan>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;\">From the first send to the primary inbox<\u002Fh2>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div style=\"position: relative; border: 1px solid #E3DFF2; border-radius: 14px; padding: 40px 32px; background-color: #FAF9FF; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(110,88,241,.17) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(47,198,238,.14) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(255,111,197,.11) 1px, transparent 1.3px); background-size: 22px 22px, 34px 34px, 46px 46px; background-position: 0 0, 11px 7px, 5px 17px;\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 14px; background: radial-gradient(90% 70% at 50% 30%, rgba(255,255,255,.92) 0%, rgba(250,249,255,.55) 60%, rgba(250,249,255,0) 100%); pointer-events: none;\"><\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; row-gap: 28px;\">\n\n        <div style=\"flex: 1 1 330px; max-width: 380px; min-width: 300px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;\">\n          <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(21,17,60,.05);\">\n            <div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 38px;\">\n              <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 13px; top: 26px; bottom: 14px; width: 0; border-left: 2px dashed #CFE9DD;\"><\u002Fspan>\n\n              <div style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-left: -38px;\">\n                <span style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #CDF1E3; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#05A063\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"><\u002Frect><path d=\"m3 8 9 6 9-6\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n                <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Primary outreach<\u002Fspan>\n                <span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D;\">Day 1<\u002Fspan>\n              <\u002Fdiv