alt=\"\" style=\"width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Sarah Johnson<\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 5px;\">Primary inbox<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#65768D\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"><\u002Frect><path d=\"m3 8 9 6 9-6\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg>Quick improvement?<\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"width: 92%; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; opacity: .72; animation: replyIn 7s ease-in-out 2.2s infinite;\">\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><img src=\"81580bce-50d6-4077-93ff-73183df645b1\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Jessica Brown<\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px;\">Primary inbox<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-top: 7px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #45556C;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E7A93\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"><\u002Frect><path d=\"m3 8 9 6 9-6\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg>Quick improvement?<\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"width: 84%; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #EAE7F4; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; opacity: .45; animation: replyIn 7s ease-in-out 2.9s infinite;\">\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;\"><img src=\"9ac002f3-b0e5-4872-91b6-50c19e0bd3c2\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #45556C;\">Kevin Roberts<\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px;\">Primary inbox<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #65768D;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E7A93\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"><\u002Frect><path d=\"m3 8 9 6 9-6\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg>Quick improvement?<\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  \n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"engine\" style=\"padding: 0 0 96px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 44px;\">\n      <span style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">Deliverability engine<\u002Fspan>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;\">Mailboxes tuned for the primary inbox<\u002Fh2>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\n      <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px 28px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.04);\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 10px;\">Slow ramp, handled for you<\u002Fh3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Each mailbox raises its own daily limit as warmup progresses. Nothing to schedule by hand.<\u002Fp>\n        <div style=\"margin-top: auto; height: 292px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-bottom: none; background: radial-gradient(118% 84% at 50% 116%, rgba(139,107,255,.30) 0%, rgba(47,198,238,.13) 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 72%), radial-gradient(70% 100% at 0% 100%, rgba(255,111,197,.13) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 62%), radial-gradient(70% 100% at 100% 100%, rgba(47,198,238,.14) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 62%), linear-gradient(180deg,#FFFFFF 0%,#FCFBFF 100%); padding: 16px 16px 0;\">\n          <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n              <img src=\"6916b7cc-0a2d-4580-980e-30122e420e15\" alt=\"Gmail\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px; display: block; flex: none;\">\n              <span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Ava Collins<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 11.5px; color: #65768D; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">ava@peakbridge.io<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; text-align: center;\">\n              <div><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 10.5px; color: #65768D; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Warmup<\u002Fspan><span style=\"position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 52 52\" style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; display: block;\"><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F1EEF8\" stroke-width=\"6\"><\u002Fcircle><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E58F1\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"138\" style=\"stroke-dashoffset: 138; transform: rotate(-90deg); transform-origin: 26px 26px; transform-box: view-box; animation: ring64 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) .1s infinite;\"><\u002Fcircle><\u002Fsvg><span style=\"position: absolute; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">64%<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n              <div><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 10.5px; color: #65768D; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Daily limit<\u002Fspan><span style=\"position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 52 52\" style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; display: block;\"><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F1EEF8\" stroke-width=\"6\"><\u002Fcircle><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B89E9\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"138\" style=\"stroke-dashoffset: 138; transform: rotate(-90deg); transform-origin: 26px 26px; transform-box: view-box; animation: ring40 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) .25s infinite;\"><\u002Fcircle><\u002Fsvg><span style=\"position: absolute; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">10<span style=\"font-size: 9px; color: #65768D;\">/25<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n              <div><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 10.5px; color: #65768D; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Campaigns<\u002Fspan><span style=\"position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 52 52\" style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; display: block;\"><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F1EEF8\" stroke-width=\"6\"><\u002Fcircle><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#05D17F\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"138\" style=\"stroke-dashoffset: 138; transform: rotate(-90deg); transform-origin: 26px 26px; transform-box: view-box; animation: ring86 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) .4s infinite;\"><\u002Fcircle><\u002Fsvg><span style=\"position: absolute; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">06<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 4px; background: #E9F1FD; border: 1px solid #CDF1E3; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><span style=\"width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 2px; background: #3B89E9;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Logan Hayes<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 11.5px; color: #65768D; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">logan@ncdata.com<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n            <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; text-align: center;\">\n              <div><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 10.5px; color: #65768D; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Warmup<\u002Fspan><span style=\"position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 52 52\" style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; display: block;\"><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F1EEF8\" stroke-width=\"6\"><\u002Fcircle><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E58F1\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"138\" style=\"stroke-dashoffset: 138; transform: rotate(-90deg); transform-origin: 26px 26px; transform-box: view-box; animation: ring36 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) .55s infinite;\"><\u002Fcircle><\u002Fsvg><span style=\"position: absolute; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">36%<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n              <div><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 10.5px; color: #65768D; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Daily limit<\u002Fspan><span style=\"position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 52 52\" style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; display: block;\"><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F1EEF8\" stroke-width=\"6\"><\u002Fcircle><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B89E9\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"138\" style=\"stroke-dashoffset: 138; transform: rotate(-90deg); transform-origin: 26px 26px; transform-box: view-box; animation: ring20 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) .7s infinite;\"><\u002Fcircle><\u002Fsvg><span style=\"position: absolute; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">5<span style=\"font-size: 9px; color: #65768D;\">/25<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n              <div><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 10.5px; color: #65768D; margin-bottom: 5px;\">Campaigns<\u002Fspan><span style=\"position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 52 52\" style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; display: block;\"><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F1EEF8\" stroke-width=\"6\"><\u002Fcircle><circle cx=\"26\" cy=\"26\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#05D17F\" stroke-width=\"6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"138\" style=\"stroke-dashoffset: 138; transform: rotate(-90deg); transform-origin: 26px 26px; transform-box: view-box; animation: ring58 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) .85s infinite;\"><\u002Fcircle><\u002Fsvg><span style=\"position: absolute; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">02<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px 28px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.04);\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 10px;\">Replies drafted the moment they land<\u002Fh3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Intent is read from the reply and an answer is written in your voice, ready to send or edit.<\u002Fp>\n        <div style=\"margin-top: auto; height: 292px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-bottom: none; background: radial-gradient(118% 84% at 50% 116%, rgba(139,107,255,.30) 0%, rgba(47,198,238,.13) 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 72%), radial-gradient(70% 100% at 0% 100%, rgba(255,111,197,.13) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 62%), radial-gradient(70% 100% at 100% 100%, rgba(47,198,238,.14) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 62%), linear-gradient(180deg,#FFFFFF 0%,#FCFBFF 100%); padding: 16px 16px 0; position: relative;\">\n          <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 16px; right: 16px; top: 44px; height: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(110,88,241,0) 0%, #6E58F1 50%, rgba(110,88,241,0) 100%); animation: aiScan 4.2s cubic-bezier(.5,0,.5,1) infinite; pointer-events: none;\"><\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n            <img src=\"578ffbbc-9910-4b8d-91e5-625a2fb13531\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\">\n            <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 8px 8px 8px 2px; padding: 10px 12px; max-width: 88%;\">\n              <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; margin-bottom: 3px;\">Emma Walsh<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: #45556C;\">Interesting — what would this look like for a team of twelve?<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 10px 37px;\">\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #E2DCF6; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 10px;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6E58F1; display: block; animation: typeDot 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;\"><\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6E58F1; display: block; animation: typeDot 1.2s ease-in-out .15s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6E58F1; display: block; animation: typeDot 1.2s ease-in-out .3s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #6E58F1;\">Drafting reply · intent: interested<\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #DAD4F7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(21,17,60,.06); animation: riseIn 8s ease-in-out 1.2s infinite;\">\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 5px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#6E58F1 0%,#3B89E9 100%); display: block; flex: none;\"><\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Suggested reply<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 4px;\">Ready<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C;\">Happy to walk you through it, Emma. For twelve seats we would start with four domains and ramp over three weeks — does Thursday at 10 work?<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px;\">\n              <span style=\"font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; background: #6E58F1; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 5px;\">Send<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D4D0E2; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 5px;\">Edit<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px 28px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.04);\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 10px;\">Out of spam, every send<\u002Fh3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Clean IPs, verified domains and paced volume keep messages in the primary tab instead of the junk folder.<\u002Fp>\n        <div style=\"margin-top: auto; height: 292px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-bottom: none; background: radial-gradient(118% 84% at 50% 116%, rgba(139,107,255,.30) 0%, rgba(47,198,238,.13) 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 72%), radial-gradient(70% 100% at 0% 100%, rgba(255,111,197,.13) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 62%), radial-gradient(70% 100% at 100% 100%, rgba(47,198,238,.14) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 62%), linear-gradient(180deg,#FFFFFF 0%,#FCFBFF 100%); padding: 20px 16px 0;\">\n          <div style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n            <div style=\"flex: none; width: 78px; text-align: center;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 44px; height: 44px; margin: 0 auto 7px; border-radius: 11px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E2DCF6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; animation: shieldFlash 3s ease-in-out infinite;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E58F1\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3 5 6v5c0 4.2 2.9 8.1 7 9 4.1-.9 7-4.8 7-9V6z\"><\u002Fpath><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #45556C;\">Filters passed<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n            <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 84px; top: 18px; width: 20px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; border: 2px solid #6E58F1; background: #fff; animation: flyToInbox 3.4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.3,1) infinite;\"><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 84px; top: 18px; width: 20px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; border: 2px solid #05D17F; background: #fff; animation: flyToInbox 3.4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.3,1) 1.7s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"flex: 1; height: 2px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#C9BFFA 0 5px, transparent 5px 10px); background-size: 20px 2px; animation: dashMove 1.1s linear infinite; margin: 0 4px;\"><\u002Fspan>\n            <div style=\"flex: none; width: 84px; text-align: center;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 44px; height: 44px; margin: 0 auto 7px; border-radius: 11px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #CDF1E3; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><img src=\"6916b7cc-0a2d-4580-980e-30122e420e15\" alt=\"Gmail\" style=\"width: 21px; height: 21px; display: block;\"><\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063;\">Primary tab<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #CDF1E3; border-radius: 7px; padding: 10px 12px;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F1EEF8; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#05A063\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Primary<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"margin-left: auto; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063;\">1,214<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fdiv>\n            <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 7px; padding: 10px 12px;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F1EFF9; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7E7A93\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" str