; background: #FF6FC5; transform-origin: bottom; animation: barGrow 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) 1.06s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n            <div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; gap: 3px; height: 100%;\"><span style=\"width: 22%; height: 25%; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; background: #9470FD; transform-origin: bottom; animation: barGrow 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) 1.1s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan><span style=\"width: 22%; height: 15%; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; background: #8B6BFF; transform-origin: bottom; animation: barGrow 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) 1.18s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan><span style=\"width: 22%; height: 6%; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; background: #FF6FC5; transform-origin: bottom; animation: barGrow 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) 1.26s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n            <div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; gap: 3px; height: 100%;\"><span style=\"width: 22%; height: 74%; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; background: #9470FD; transform-origin: bottom; animation: barGrow 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) 1.3s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan><span style=\"width: 22%; height: 43%; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; background: #8B6BFF; transform-origin: bottom; animation: barGrow 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) 1.38s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan><span style=\"width: 22%; height: 17%; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0; background: #FF6FC5; transform-origin: bottom; animation: barGrow 7s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1) 1.46s infinite;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 2%; padding-left: 30px; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #7E7A93;\">\n            <span style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">8 Sep<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">9 Sep<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">10 Sep<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">11 Sep<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">12 Sep<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">13 Sep<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"flex: 1; text-align: center;\">14 Sep<\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  \n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"deliverability\" data-sec=\"deliverability\" style=\"position: relative; padding: 96px 0; background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, #F4F1FF 0%, #FBFAFE 62%, #FBFAFE 100%); border-top: 1px solid #E9E6F3; border-bottom: 1px solid #E9E6F3;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n      <span style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">AI replies<\u002Fspan>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;\">A reply comes in. A meeting comes out.<\u002Fh2>\n      <p style=\"max-width: 680px; margin: 0; font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C; text-align: center;\">Autopilot reads the reply, answers in your voice and puts the call on your calendar. You show up to a booked meeting.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div style=\"position: relative; margin: 44px 0 0; padding: 30px 26px 26px; border: 1px solid #E3DFF2; border-radius: 16px; background-color: #FAF9FF; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(110,88,241,.17) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(47,198,238,.14) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(255,111,197,.11) 1px, transparent 1.3px); background-size: 22px 22px, 34px 34px, 46px 46px; background-position: 0 0, 11px 7px, 5px 17px;\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 16px; background: radial-gradient(80% 70% at 50% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.94) 0%, rgba(250,249,255,.55) 62%, rgba(250,249,255,0) 100%); pointer-events: none;\"><\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 22px;\">\n        <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\"><img src=\"e49f99c7-9e5c-410e-b211-3970de2548cf\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 6px; display: block;\">Autopilot<\u002Fspan>\n        <span style=\"flex: 1; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: #E6E1D5; overflow: hidden; min-width: 40px;\"><span style=\"display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#2FC6EE 0%,#8B6BFF 52%,#FF6FC5 100%); animation: railFill 13s linear infinite both;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n        <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex: none; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #CDF1E3; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 999px;\"><span style=\"width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05D17F; display: block; animation: pulseDot 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;\"><\u002Fspan>Live · 63s average<\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div data-flowrow=\"1\" style=\"position: relative; display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; row-gap: 18px;\">\n\n        <div data-stage=\"1\" style=\"flex: 1 1 230px; min-width: 240px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; animation: stageOn 13s ease-in-out 0s infinite both;\">\n          <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;\">\n            <span style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 7px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none; animation: numOn 13s ease-in-out 0s infinite both;\">01<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Reply lands<\u002Fspan>\n            <img src=\"6916b7cc-0a2d-4580-980e-30122e420e15\" alt=\"Gmail\" style=\"width: 16px; height: 16px; display: block; margin-left: auto; flex: none;\">\n          <\u002Fspan>\n          <div style=\"background: #FBFAFF; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px;\">\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 7px;\">\n              <img src=\"578ffbbc-9910-4b8d-91e5-625a2fb13531\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\">\n              <span style=\"min-width: 0;\">\n                <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Emma Walsh<\u002Fspan>\n                <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; color: #65768D; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">VP Marketing, Voltera<\u002Fspan>\n              <\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; font-size: 10.5px; color: #7E7A93;\">09:12<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: #45556C;\">Interesting — what would this look like for a team of twelve?<\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <span style=\"margin-top: auto; font-size: 11.5px; color: #65768D;\">Pulled from any mailbox into one inbox.<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n\n        <div data-connector=\"1\" style=\"flex: none; width: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 6px;\">\n          <span style=\"position: relative; flex: 1; height: 2px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#C9BFFA 0 5px, transparent 5px 10px); background-size: 20px 2px; animation: dashMove 1.1s linear infinite;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; top: -3px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6E58F1; animation: pulseAcross 13s linear 2.4s infinite both;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n\n        <div data-stage=\"1\" style=\"flex: 1 1 230px; min-width: 240px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; animation: stageOn 13s ease-in-out 3.25s infinite both;\">\n          <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;\">\n            <span style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 7px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none; animation: numOn 13s ease-in-out 3.25s infinite both;\">02<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Intent read<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #CDF1E3; border-top-color: #6E58F1; display: block; margin-left: auto; flex: none; animation: spin .9s linear infinite;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fspan>\n          <div style=\"background: #F7F5FE; border: 1px solid #E2DCF6; border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px;\">\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n              <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #6E58F1;\">Reading the reply<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #6E58F1;\">interested<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: block; height: 4px; border-radius: 2px; background: #E6E1FA; overflow: hidden;\"><span style=\"display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#2FC6EE 0%,#8B6BFF 52%,#FF6FC5 100%); animation: barFill 13s ease-in-out 3.3s infinite both;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 11px;\">\n              <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #45556C; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; animation: popIn 13s ease-in-out 4s infinite both;\">12 seats<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #45556C; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; animation: popIn 13s ease-in-out 4.3s infinite both;\">wants pricing<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #45556C; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 999px; animation: popIn 13s ease-in-out 4.6s infinite both;\">meeting-ready<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <span style=\"margin-top: auto; font-size: 11.5px; color: #65768D;\">Team size, budget and urgency tagged.<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n\n        <div data-connector=\"1\" style=\"flex: none; width: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 6px;\">\n          <span style=\"position: relative; flex: 1; height: 2px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#C9BFFA 0 5px, transparent 5px 10px); background-size: 20px 2px; animation: dashMove 1.1s linear infinite .2s;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; top: -3px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3B89E9; animation: pulseAcross 13s linear 5.7s infinite both;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n\n        <div data-stage=\"1\" style=\"flex: 1 1 230px; min-width: 240px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; animation: stageOn 13s ease-in-out 6.5s infinite both;\">\n          <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;\">\n            <span style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 7px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none; animation: numOn 13s ease-in-out 6.5s infinite both;\">03<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Answer sent<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #05A063; background: #F1EEF8; padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 4px; animation: popIn 13s ease-in-out 7.6s infinite both;\">09:13<\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fspan>\n          <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #DAD4F7; border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(21,17,60,.05);\">\n            <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 7px;\">\n              <span style=\"width: 17px; height: 17px; border-radius: 5px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#6E58F1 0%,#3B89E9 100%); display: block; flex: none;\"><\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Replied as Alex Moore<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: #45556C;\">For twelve seats we would start with four domains and ramp over three weeks. Two slots open this week<span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 2px; height: 13px; background: #6E58F1; margin-left: 2px; vertical-align: -2px; animation: caretBlink 1s step-end infinite;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <span style=\"margin-top: auto; font-size: 11.5px; color: #65768D;\">Your wording, your offer, one minute later.<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n\n        <div data-connector=\"1\" style=\"flex: none; width: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 6px;\">\n          <span style=\"position: relative; flex: 1; height: 2px; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#C9BFFA 0 5px, transparent 5px 10px); background-size: 20px 2px; animation: dashMove 1.1s linear infinite .4s;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; top: -3px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05D17F; animation: pulseAcross 13s linear 8.9s infinite both;\"><\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n\n        <div data-stage=\"1\" style=\"flex: 1 1 230px; min-width: 240px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; animation: stageOn 13s ease-in-out 9.75s infinite both;\">\n          <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;\">\n            <span style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 7px; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none; animation: numOn 13s ease-in-out 9.75s infinite both;\">04<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Meeting booked<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05D17F; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; animation: popIn 13s ease-in-out 10.4s infinite both;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fspan>\n          <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #CDF1E3; border-radius: 9px; padding: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px;\">\n            <img src=\"f3cfe9c3-28de-4ac5-9e4a-ed7663d1e901\" alt=\"Calendar\" style=\"width: 30px; height: 30px; display: block; flex: none;\">\n            <span style=\"min-width: 0;\">\n              <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Intro call · Thu 10:00<\u002Fspan>\n              <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 11px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px;\">Emma Walsh · 30 min<\u002Fspan>\n            <\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <div style=\"background: #FBFAFF; border: 1px solid #E8E5F2; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px;\">\n            <span style=\"font-size: 11.5px; color: #65768D;\">Invite sent · added to CRM<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05D17F; display: block; animation: pulseDot 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <span style=\"margin-top: auto; font-size: 11.5px; color: #65768D;\">Slot taken from your calendar, invite sent.<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-top: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px;\">\n        <span style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 9px; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E58F1\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"><\u002Fcircle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n        <div>\n          <h4 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 6px;\">Answers in minutes<\u002Fh4>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0;\">Speed is what converts a cold reply. Every message is answered while the prospect is still at their desk.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px;\">\n        <span style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 9px; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3B89E9\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n        <div>\n          <h4 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 6px;\">Written in your voice<\u002Fh4>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0;\">Trained on your past threads and your offer. Approve each draft or let it send on its own.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px;\">\n        <span style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 9px; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#05A063\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\"><\u002Frect><path d=\"M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 11h18\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n        <div>\n          <h4 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 6px;\">Straight onto the calendar<\u002Fh4>\n          <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0;\">Interested prospects see your real availability, pick a slot and the invite goes out. No lost leads.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  \n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"inbox\" data-sec=\"inbox\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 96px 0; background-color: #FBFAFE; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(110,88,241,.17) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(47,198,238,.14) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(255,111,197,.11) 1px, transparent 1.3px); background-size: 22px 22px, 34px 34px, 46px 46px; background-position: 0 0, 11px 7px, 5px 17px; border-top: 1px solid #E9E6F3; border-bottom: 1px solid #E9E6F3;\">\n  <div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(90% 70% at 50% 10%, rgba(251,250,254,.94) 0%, rgba(251,250,254,.62) 58%, rgba(251,250,254,.2) 100%); pointer-events: none;\"><\u002Fdiv>\n  <div data-inboxgrid=\"1\" style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 360px) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 44px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div data-inboxcopy=\"1\" style=\"min-width: 0;\">\n      <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Unibox Pro<\u002Fspan>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 28px;\">One inbox for every reply<\u002Fh2>\n      <div data-inboxfeats=\"1\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; position: relative; padding-left: 16px;\">\n          <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 4px; bottom: 4px; width: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#2FC6EE 0%,#8B6BFF 52%,#FF6FC5 100%); transform-origin: top;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #E2DCF6; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E58F1\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.6\"><\u002Frect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"4\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.6\"><\u002Frect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.6\"><\u002Frect><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.6\"><\u002Frect><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n          <div>\n            <h4 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 7px;\">Every campaign in one view<\u002Fh4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0;\">Replies from all mailboxes and all clients land in a shared inbox instead of a dozen tabs.<\u002Fp>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; position: relative; padding-left: 16px;\">\n          <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 4px; bottom: 4px; width: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#2FC6EE 0%,#8B6BFF 52%,#FF6FC5 100%); transform-origin: top;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #E2DCF6; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E58F1\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H8l-5 3V6a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h12a3 3 0 0 1 3 3z\"><\u002Fpath><path d=\"M8 10h8M8 13h5\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n          <div>\n            <h4 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 7px;\">Answered in your voice<\u002Fh4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0;\">Intent is read from the reply and the answer is drafted and sent while the prospect is still reading.<\u002Fp>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 16px; position: relative; padding-left: 16px;\">\n          <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; top: 4px; bottom: 4px; width: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: linear-gradient(135deg,#2FC6EE 0%,#8B6BFF 52%,#FF6FC5 100%); transform-origin: top;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #F1EEF8; border: 1px solid #E2DCF6; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6E58F1\" stroke-width=\"1.9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"><\u002Fcircle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n          <div>\n            <h4 style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 7px;\">Nothing left waiting<\u002Fh4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C; margin: 0;\">Hot replies move to the top, follow-ups schedule themselves and the CRM stays current without manual entry.<\u002Fp>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div data-inboxwrap=\"1\" style=\"position: relative; min-width: 0; margin-right: -72px;\">\n      <img src=\"666e2d95-17f2-4e7f-8892-e2aa5511e1dd\" alt=\"Unibox with an AI reply drafted for an interested lead\" style=\"width: 100%; min-width: min(700px, 100%); height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 12px; filter: drop-shadow(-6px 16px 44px rgba(21,17,60,.14));\">\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section style=\"position: relative; padding: 96px 0; overflow: hidden; background-color: #FAF9FF; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(110,88,241,.17) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(47,198,238,.14) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(255,111,197,.11) 1px, transparent 1.3px); background-size: 22px 22px, 34px 34px, 46px 46px; background-position: 0 0, 11px 7px, 5px 17px; border-top: 1px solid #E9E6F3; border-bottom: 1px solid #E9E6F3;\">\n  <div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,.92) 0%, rgba(250,249,255,.4) 60%, rgba(250,249,255,0) 100%); pointer-events: none;\"><\u002Fdiv>\n  <div style=\"position: relative; max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto 48px; padding: 0 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 18px;\">\n    <span style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">Reviews<\u002Fspan>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;\">What changed after a quarter<\u002Fh2>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n  <div style=\"position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\">\n  <div data-marquee=\"1\" style=\"display: flex; width: 100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; padding-right: 20px; animation: marquee 52s linear infinite; will-change: transform;\"><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"bea15e34-0da9-4f20-90a2-891f38eaace8\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Sarah Johnson<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">VP Marketing, Northbeam<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #6E58F1; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">NB<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">We moved 7,700 mailboxes over in a weekend. Reply rates held and the deliverability noise stopped for good.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"00b87709-f1bb-448b-8bc5-0326a42411ec\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Michael Anderson<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Operating partner, Voltera<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #3B89E9; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">VO<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Fifteen portfolio companies run on one account. Billing is simple and nobody asks me for mailbox budget.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"81580bce-50d6-4077-93ff-73183df645b1\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Jessica Brown<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Head of growth, Cadence<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #05A063; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">CA<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Booked 73 demos in a month from a standing start, with no prior B2B sales motion in the company.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"9ac002f3-b0e5-4872-91b6-50c19e0bd3c2\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Kevin Roberts<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">RevOps lead, Pilotfish<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #D98A2B; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">PF<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">The API is the reason we stayed. Everything we used to script by hand is two calls now.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"bea15e34-0da9-4f20-90a2-891f38eaace8\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Sarah Johnson<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">VP Marketing, Northbeam<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #6E58F1; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">NB<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">We moved 7,700 mailboxes over in a weekend. Reply rates held and the deliverability noise stopped for good.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"00b87709-f1bb-448b-8bc5-0326a42411ec\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Michael Anderson<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Operating partner, Voltera<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #3B89E9; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">VO<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Fifteen portfolio companies run on one account. Billing is simple and nobody asks me for mailbox budget.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"81580bce-50d6-4077-93ff-73183df645b1\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Jessica Brown<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Head of growth, Cadence<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #05A063; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">CA<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Booked 73 demos in a month from a standing start, with no prior B2B sales motion in the company.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"9ac002f3-b0e5-4872-91b6-50c19e0bd3c2\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Kevin Roberts<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">RevOps lead, Pilotfish<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #D98A2B; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">PF<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">The API is the reason we stayed. Everything we used to script by hand is two calls now.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n  <div data-marquee=\"1\" style=\"display: flex; width: 100%;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; padding-right: 20px; animation: marqueeRev 58s linear infinite; will-change: transform;\"><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"578ffbbc-9910-4b8d-91e5-625a2fb13531\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Emma Walsh<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Founder, Rowan Labs<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #6E58F1; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">RL<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">AI replies answer within the minute. That alone doubled the share of replies that turn into calls.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"8b2419df-8ce0-4c03-bfdb-fcd66b8fab90\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Daniel Foster<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Sales director, Merida<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #05A063; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">ME<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Two people now handle the volume that needed five. Inbox triage is most of that difference.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"99045165-c014-4444-8177-4433b57a30d1\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">David Ortiz<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Agency ops, Basewell<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #D98A2B; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">BW<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Onboarding took an afternoon, including DNS for eleven domains. Warmup I have not touched since.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"578ffbbc-9910-4b8d-91e5-625a2fb13531\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Emma Walsh<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Founder, Rowan Labs<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #6E58F1; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">RL<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">AI replies answer within the minute. That alone doubled the share of replies that turn into calls.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"8b2419df-8ce0-4c03-bfdb-fcd66b8fab90\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">Daniel Foster<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Sales director, Merida<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #05A063; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">ME<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Two people now handle the volume that needed five. Inbox triage is most of that difference.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><div style=\"width: 392px; flex: none; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><img src=\"99045165-c014-4444-8177-4433b57a30d1\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; display: block; flex: none;\"><span style=\"min-width: 0;\"><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; letter-spacing: -0.01em;\">David Ortiz<\u002Fspan><span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #65768D; margin-top: 2px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">Agency ops, Basewell<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan><span style=\"margin-left: auto; flex: none; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 8px; background: #D98A2B; color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .02em; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\">BW<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Onboarding took an afternoon, including DNS for eleven domains. Warmup I have not touched since.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv><\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"senders\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 96px 0; background: #FBFAFE; border-top: 1px solid #E9E6F3;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\">\n      <span style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">Any provider<\u002Fspan>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance;\">Send from Gmail, Outlook or your own servers<\u002Fh2>\n      <p style=\"max-width: 660px; margin: 0; font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">One campaign can rotate across all three at once. Connect a mailbox in two clicks or point us at your SMTP credentials and we pace every sender for you.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div data-provwrap=\"1\" style=\"position: relative; max-width: 940px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n      <img src=\"943a36b5-6418-4cea-8407-cd6e19fbf9ab\" alt=\"Outlook and Gmail mailboxes and dedicated SMTP servers connected to one sending hub\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 16px;\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 9.52%; top: 38.33%; width: 24.03%; height: 34.34%; transform-origin: center; animation: provLift 12s ease-in-out 0s infinite both;\">\n        <img src=\"7f7a03c8-6d63-4e51-8ebc-adc6879c4434\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(110,88,241,.22);\">\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; border: 2px solid #8B6BFF; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(139,107,255,.14);\"><\u002Fspan>\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -15px; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D3E4FA; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 11px; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(21,17,60,.14);\">\n          <span style=\"width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #3B89E9; display: block;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Outlook<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #5A5670;\">direct send<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 38.39%; top: 38.33%; width: 23.31%; height: 34.7%; transform-origin: center; animation: provLift 12s ease-in-out 4s infinite both;\">\n        <img src=\"0b4ffc0d-986f-4e91-996b-7cc1f5f53153\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(110,88,241,.22);\">\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; border: 2px solid #8B6BFF; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(139,107,255,.14);\"><\u002Fspan>\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -15px; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #DAD4F7; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 11px; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(21,17,60,.14);\">\n          <span style=\"width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #6E58F1; display: block;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Gmail<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #5A5670;\">direct send<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 66.69%; top: 38.33%; width: 23.71%; height: 34.46%; transform-origin: center; animation: provLift 12s ease-in-out 8s infinite both;\">\n        <img src=\"fbec4e16-1502-4a79-bf7f-f2f49b1c7764\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 18px 38px rgba(110,88,241,.22);\">\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; border: 2px solid #8B6BFF; border-radius: 14px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(139,107,255,.14);\"><\u002Fspan>\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: -15px; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #CBE8DA; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px 11px; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(21,17,60,.14);\">\n          <span style=\"width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05A063; display: block;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">SMTP<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 11px; color: #5A5670;\">dedicated servers<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 36px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;\">\n        <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin-bottom: 7px;\">Two-click connection<\u002Fspan>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C;\">OAuth for Google and Microsoft. No app passwords, no IMAP fiddling.<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;\">\n        <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin-bottom: 7px;\">Rotation across senders<\u002Fspan>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C;\">Volume spreads over every connected mailbox, each paced to its own limit.<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px;\">\n        <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #0F172B; margin-bottom: 7px;\">Your own infrastructure<\u002Fspan>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: #45556C;\">Bring dedicated SMTP servers and keep the reputation on your side.<\u002Fp>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"timezones\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 96px 0; background-color: #FBFAFE; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(110,88,241,.17) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(47,198,238,.14) 1px, transparent 1.3px), radial-gradient(rgba(255,111,197,.11) 1px, transparent 1.3px); background-size: 22px 22px, 34px 34px, 46px 46px; background-position: 0 0, 11px 7px, 5px 17px; border-top: 1px solid #E9E6F3; border-bottom: 1px solid #E9E6F3;\">\n  <div style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(90% 70% at 50% 10%, rgba(251,250,254,.94) 0%, rgba(251,250,254,.6) 58%, rgba(251,250,254,.2) 100%); pointer-events: none;\"><\u002Fdiv>\n  <div data-tzgrid=\"1\" style=\"position: relative; max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(300px, 420px) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 56px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div style=\"min-width: 0;\">\n      <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Global sending<\u002Fspan>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Every email lands at 9am, wherever they are<\u002Fh2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C; margin: 0 0 28px;\">Set one sending window and onepulso schedules each contact in their own timezone. A list spread across twelve countries goes out in twelve local mornings, not one of yours.<\u002Fp>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n        <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\"><span style=\"width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #E1F1EC; border: 1px solid #CBE8DA; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0A7A52\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>Timezone detected from the contact, not the list<\u002Fspan>\n        <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\"><span style=\"width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #E1F1EC; border: 1px solid #CBE8DA; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0A7A52\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>Weekends and local holidays skipped<\u002Fspan>\n        <span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\"><span style=\"width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #E1F1EC; border: 1px solid #CBE8DA; flex: none; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0A7A52\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>Follow-ups keep the same local hour<\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <div style=\"position: relative; min-width: 0;\">\n      <div data-mapbox=\"1\" style=\"position: relative; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n        <img src=\"fb1b4aa2-24f8-4b38-9d94-fa76b7ab0549\" alt=\"Sending routed from one hub to contacts in Canada, the US, Mexico, Brazil, Argentina, the UK, Germany, France, the UAE, India, Japan and Australia\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; border-radius: 16px;\">\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 42.36%; top: 16.45%; width: 10.55%; transform-origin: center; animation: flagPop 15s ease-in-out 0.00s infinite both;\">\n        <img src=\"0f212683-6727-468d-8727-59d88aafcac5\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 78%, transparent 95%); mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 78%, transparent 95%);\">\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 112%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #DAD4F7; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 9px; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(21,17,60,.14); animation: tagPop 15s ease-in-out 0.00s infinite both;\">\n          <span style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05D17F; display: block;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">London<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; color: #5A5670;\">14:04 local<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 61.09%; top: 19.64%; width: 10.55%; transform-origin: center; animation: flagPop 15s ease-in-out 3.75s infinite both;\">\n        <img src=\"10cfd284-1737-43a1-814c-248ebf673262\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 78%, transparent 95%); mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 78%, transparent 95%);\">\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 112%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #DAD4F7; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 9px; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(21,17,60,.14); animation: tagPop 15s ease-in-out 3.75s infinite both;\">\n          <span style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05D17F; display: block;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Berlin<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; color: #5A5670;\">15:04 local<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 61.82%; top: 50.36%; width: 10.55%; transform-origin: center; animation: flagPop 15s ease-in-out 7.50s infinite both;\">\n        <img src=\"215476cf-87f5-401e-b064-dd4868676065\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 78%, transparent 95%); mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 78%, transparent 95%);\">\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 112%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #DAD4F7; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 9px; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(21,17,60,.14); animation: tagPop 15s ease-in-out 7.50s infinite both;\">\n          <span style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05D17F; display: block;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Dubai<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; color: #5A5670;\">17:04 local<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"position: absolute; left: 24%; top: 59.09%; width: 10.55%; transform-origin: center; animation: flagPop 15s ease-in-out 11.25s infinite both;\">\n        <img src=\"07f27821-4128-4490-a7ff-9185a0486f67\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 78%, transparent 95%); mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #000 0%, #000 60%, rgba(0,0,0,.55) 78%, transparent 95%);\">\n        <span style=\"position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 112%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #DAD4F7; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 9px; white-space: nowrap; box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(21,17,60,.14); animation: tagPop 15s ease-in-out 11.25s infinite both;\">\n          <span style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #05D17F; display: block;\"><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">São Paulo<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; color: #5A5670;\">10:04 local<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"trust\" style=\"position: relative; padding: 76px 0; background: #FBFAFE; border-top: 1px solid #E9E6F3;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px; text-align: center;\">\n      <span style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">Verified platform<\u002Fspan>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance;\">Software your compliance team signs off on<\u002Fh2>\n      <p style=\"max-width: 640px; margin: 0; font-size: 17.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Sending on your behalf means holding your data to the same standard you do. Here is what that looks like in practice.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 26px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04); max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n      <img src=\"6ebf1a71-8f2b-4717-b966-e485a7be053e\" alt=\"Trusted by 400+ companies, enterprise ready, 99.9% uptime, GDPR compliant data protection, verified software, expert support\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 820px; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"pricing\" data-sec=\"pricing\" style=\"padding: 40px 0 96px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 32px;\">\n      <span style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; color: #6E58F1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05);\">Pricing<\u002Fspan>\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0; text-align: center;\">Compare the plans<\u002Fh2>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #E6F4EE; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 5px;\">\n        <span sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ setMonthly }}\" style=\"{{ monthlyPill }}\">Monthly<\u002Fspan>\n        <span sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ setYearly }}\" style=\"{{ yearlyPill }}\">Yearly <span style=\"font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0A7A52;\">17% off<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div style=\"overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 12px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(21,17,60,.04);\">\n      <div style=\"min-width: 900px; display: flex; align-items: stretch;\">\n        <div style=\"flex: 1.15 1 230px; min-width: 210px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;\">\n          <div style=\"height: 224px; padding: 24px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end;\">\n            <span style=\"display: block; font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B;\">Features<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"display: block; font-size: 13.5px; color: #5A5670; margin-top: 6px;\">{{ billingNote }}<\u002Fspan>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Emails per month<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Contacts stored<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Connected mailboxes<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Automated warmup<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">AI Agent replies<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Personalization tokens<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Unibox<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Smart chatbot<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Analytics<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Sending speed<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Client workspaces<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">White label<\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; font-size: 15.5px; color: #45556C;\">Support<\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <div data-plan=\"1\" style=\"flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 168px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative; border-left: 1px solid #EAE7F4; background: transparent; transition: background .18s ease, box-shadow .22s ease;\" style-hover=\"background: #EFF6F1; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #9FD2BC inset, 0 14px 34px rgba(110,88,241,.13); z-index: 2;\">\n          <div style=\"height: 224px; padding: 0 16px 22px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 10px; text-align: center; align-items: stretch;\">\n            <span style=\"display: inline-block; align-self: flex-start; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; color: transparent; padding: 4px 10px;\">&nbsp;<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #6E58F1;\">Starter<\u002Fspan>\n            <span style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 40px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap;\">{{ pStarter }}<span style=\"font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #5A5670;\">/mo<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n            <a href=\"#signup\" style=\"display: block; text-align: center; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #6E58F1; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #BFE0D2; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\" style-hover=\"background: #F5F8F4;\">Choose<\u002Fa>\n          <\u002Fdiv>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; line-height: 1.25;\">15,000<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-co