"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; line-height: 1.25;\">Revenue attribution<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; line-height: 1.25;\">Custom pacing<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; line-height: 1.25;\">11 clients<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4;\"><svg sc-camel-view-box=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#05A063\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m5 13 4 4L19 7\"><\u002Fpath><\u002Fsvg><\u002Fspan>\n          <span style=\"height: 62px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 0 12px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; line-height: 1.25;\">Named engineer · 1h<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <p style=\"margin: 16px 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #5A5670; text-align: center;\">Every plan includes unlimited mailboxes, automated warmup and the AI Agent. 14 days free, no card required.<\u002Fp>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section id=\"faq\" style=\"padding: 0 0 96px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 42px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #0F172B; margin: 0 0 32px; text-align: center;\">Questions we get every week<\u002Fh2>\n    <details style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n      <summary style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 22px 24px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Do mailboxes cost extra?<span data-plus=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; color: #6E58F1; transition: transform .3s ease; line-height: 1;\">+<\u002Fspan><\u002Fsummary>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0 24px 22px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">No. Connect as many as you want on any plan. Pricing follows send volume and AI Agent replies, so adding senders to spread that volume costs nothing.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdetails>\n    <details style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n      <summary style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 22px 24px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">How long does warmup take before I can send?<span data-plus=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; color: #6E58F1; transition: transform .3s ease; line-height: 1;\">+<\u002Fspan><\u002Fsummary>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0 24px 22px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Two to three weeks for a fresh domain. Warmup keeps running once campaigns start, and volume ramps on its own as reputation builds.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdetails>\n    <details style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n      <summary style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 22px 24px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Can I bring my own domains and IPs?<span data-plus=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; color: #6E58F1; transition: transform .3s ease; line-height: 1;\">+<\u002Fspan><\u002Fsummary>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0 24px 22px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">Yes. Existing domains connect in a few minutes, and client workspaces and white label are available from the Growth plan upward.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdetails>\n    <details style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E6E3F0; border-radius: 8px;\">\n      <summary style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; padding: 22px 24px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B;\">Does it work for agencies with many clients?<span data-plus=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; color: #6E58F1; transition: transform .3s ease; line-height: 1;\">+<\u002Fspan><\u002Fsummary>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0 24px 22px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: #45556C;\">That is most of our base. From the Growth plan you can create a workspace per client and white label the whole thing under your own brand.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdetails>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<section style=\"padding: 0 0 96px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;\">\n    <div style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 20px; background: #312A63; background-image: radial-gradient(120% 100% at 50% 0%, rgba(160,138,255,.5) 0%, rgba(110,88,241,0) 64%); border: 1px solid #463C85; padding: 84px 24px; text-align: center;\">\n      <h2 style=\"font-family: 'Schibsted Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(30px, 4.4vw, 56px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.035em; color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 auto 20px; max-width: 780px; text-wrap: balance;\">Stop landing in spam. Start booking meetings.<\u002Fh2>\n      <p style=\"max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto 32px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: #E0DCFA;\">Unlimited mailboxes, warmup and AI replies are included on every plan. Send your first campaign today and move your existing senders over when you are ready.<\u002Fp>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n        <a href=\"#demo\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #EDEAFA; background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); padding: 13px 24px; border-radius: 8px;\" style-hover=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-color: rgba(167,139,250,.55);\">Book a demo<\u002Fa>\n        <a href=\"#signup\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #FFFFFF; background: #6E58F1; padding: 14px 26px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(110,88,241,.38);\" style-hover=\"background: #7F6BFF;\">Start free trial<\u002Fa>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<footer style=\"border-top: 1px solid #E6E3F0; background: #fff;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 24px 32px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 40px;\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n        <img src=\"d9e35f00-9944-48c7-a125-23e70065276e\" alt=\"onepulso\" style=\"height: 26px; width: auto; display: block;\">\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #65768D; max-width: 280px;\">Cold email infrastructure for teams that send at volume.<\u002Fp>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Product<\u002Fdiv>\n      <a href=\"#scale\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">Sending<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#deliverability\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">AI replies<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#inbox\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">Master Inbox<\u002Fa>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Company<\u002Fdiv>\n      <a href=\"#about\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">About<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#careers\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">Careers<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#partners\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">Partners<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#contact\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">Contact<\u002Fa>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172B; margin-bottom: 4px;\">Resources<\u002Fdiv>\n      <a href=\"#docs\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">Docs<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#api\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">API<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#status\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">Status<\u002Fa>\n      <a href=\"#faq\" style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #45556C;\">FAQ<\u002Fa>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1230px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 24px 40px; border-top: 1px solid #EAE7F4; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 14px; color: #65768D;\">\n    <span>© 2026 onepulso. All rights reserved.<\u002Fspan>\n    <span style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px;\"><a href=\"#privacy\" style=\"color: #65768D;\">Privacy<\u002Fa><a href=\"#terms\" style=\"color: #65768D;\">Terms<\u002Fa><\u002Fspan>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Ffooter>\n\n<\u002Fx-dc>\n<script type=\"text/x-dc\" data-dc-script=\"\" data-props=\"{&quot;showBanner&quot;:{&quot;editor&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;default&quot;:true,&quot;tsType&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;section&quot;:&quot;Layout&quot;},&quot;stickyNav&quot;:{&quot;editor&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;default&quot;:true,&quot;tsType&quot;:&quot;boolean&quot;,&quot;section&quot;:&quot;Layout&quot;},&quot;autoplaySeconds&quot;:{&quot;editor&quot;:&quot;range&quot;,&quot;default&quot;:6,&quot;min&quot;:3,&quot;max&quot;:14,&quot;step&quot;:1,&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;s&quot;,&quot;tsType&quot;:&quot;number&quot;,&quot;section&quot;:&quot;Behaviour&quot;}}\">\nclass Component extends DCLogic {\n  state = { tab: 0, slide: 0, tp: 0, sp: 0, yearly: false, active: null };\n\n  navPill(on) {\n    return {\n      fontSize: '14px', fontWeight: 600, padding: '9px 18px', borderRadius: '999px',\n      whiteSpace: 'nowrap', transition: 'color .18s ease, background .18s ease',\n      color: on ? '#5B40FB' : '#5A5670',\n      background: on ? '#F1EEF8' : 'transparent',\n      border: '1px solid ' + (on ? '#C9BFFA' : 'transparent'),\n      boxShadow: on ? 'inset 0 -7px 11px rgba(151,127,255,.28)' : 'none'\n    };\n  }\n\n  pill(on) {\n    return {\n      display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', gap: '5px', cursor: 'pointer',\n      fontSize: '14px', fontWeight: 600, padding: '8px 16px', borderRadius: '999px',\n      color: on ? '#0F172B' : '#65768D',\n      background: on ? '#FFFFFF' : 'transparent',\n      border: on ? '1px solid #E6E3F0' : '1px solid transparent',\n      boxShadow: on ? '0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.06)' : 'none',\n      transition: 'all .2s ease'\n    };\n  }\n\n  componentDidMount() {\n    this.timer = setInterval(() => this.tick(), 60);\n    this.onScroll = () => this.spy();\n    window.addEventListener('scroll', this.onScroll, { passive: true });\n    this.spy();\n  }\n\n  componentWillUnmount() {\n    clearInterval(this.timer);\n    window.removeEventListener('scroll', this.onScroll);\n  }\n\n  dur() {\n    const s = Number(this.props.autoplaySeconds);\n    return (s > 0 ? s : 6) * 1000;\n  }\n\n  tick() {\n    const step = (60 / this.dur()) * 100;\n    this.setState(s => {\n      const tp = s.tp + step, sp = s.sp + step;\n      return {\n        tp: tp >= 100 ? 0 : tp,\n        tab: tp >= 100 ? (s.tab + 1) % 3 : s.tab,\n        sp: sp >= 100 ? 0 : sp,\n        slide: sp >= 100 ? (s.slide + 1) % 3 : s.slide\n      };\n    });\n  }\n\n  spy() {\n    const secs = document.querySelectorAll('[data-sec]');\n    let current = null;\n    secs.forEach(el => {\n      const r = el.getBoundingClientRect();\n      if (r.top <= 220 && r.bottom > 220) current = el.getAttribute('data-sec');\n    });\n    if (current !== this.state.active) this.setState({ active: current });\n  }\n\n  pick(key, progKey, i) {\n    this.setState({ [key]: i, [progKey]: 0 });\n  }\n\n  renderVals() {\n    const y = this.state.yearly;\n    const v = {\n      showBanner: this.props.showBanner ?? true,\n      showNav: this.props.stickyNav ?? true,\n      pStarter: y ? '$14' : '$17',\n      pGrowth: y ? '$54' : '$65',\n      pScale: y ? '$141' : '$170',\n      billingNote: y ? 'Billed yearly, 17% off' : 'Billed monthly',\n      monthlyPill: this.pill(!y),\n      yearlyPill: this.pill(y),\n      navScale: this.navPill(this.state.active === 'scale'),\n      navInfra: this.navPill(this.state.active === 'infra'),\n      navDeliverability: this.navPill(this.state.active === 'deliverability'),\n      navInbox: this.navPill(this.state.active === 'inbox'),\n      navPricing: this.navPill(this.state.active === 'pricing'),\n      setMonthly: () => this.setState({ yearly: false }),\n      setYearly: () => this.setState({ yearly: true })\n    };\n    for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n      v['ta' + i] = { opacity: this.state.tab === i ? 1 : 0.45, transition: 'opacity .35s ease' };\n      v['sa' + i] = { opacity: this.state.slide === i ? 1 : 0.45, transition: 'opacity .35s ease' };\n      v['tw' + i] = {\n        display: 'block', height: '100%', background: '#6E58F1', borderRadius: '2px',\n        width: this.state.tab === i ? this.state.tp + '%' : '0%'\n      };\n      v['sw' + i] = {\n        display: 'block', height: '100%', background: '#6E58F1', borderRadius: '2px',\n        width: this.state.slide === i ? this.state.sp + '%' : '0%'\n      };\n      v['tv' + i] = {\n        position: 'absolute', inset: 0, transition: 'opacity .5s ease',\n        opacity: this.state.tab === i ? 1 : 0,\n        pointerEvents: this.state.tab === i ? 'auto' : 'none'\n      };\n      v['sv' + i] = {\n        position: 'absolute', inset: 0, transition: 'opacity .5s ease',\n        opacity: this.state.slide === i ? 1 : 0,\n        pointerEvents: this.state.slide === i ? 'auto' : 'none'\n      };\n      v['tab' + i] = () => this.pick('tab', 'tp', i);\n      v['slide' + i] = () => this.pick('slide', 'sp', i);\n    }\n    return v;\n  }\n}\n<\u002Fscript>\n\n\n<\u002Fbody><\u002Fhtml>"
  </script>
</body>
</html>